 scales with binding cords hidden beneath. A high-grade armor of sophisticated construction."},"defenceVal":"6","price":"2400","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1023305","name":{"zh":"校尉铁胄","en":"Captain's Iron Helm"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"带有盔缨装饰的铁胄，各地校尉的标配。","en":"An iron helm adorned with a plume, standard issue for regional colonels."},"defenceVal":"2","price":"1000","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10014","code":"0"}]},"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10462","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI111715","name":{"zh":"常山赵氏","en":"The Zhao clan of Changshan"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自嬴姓，战国赵国王族支庶余脉。秦汉时期，南越王赵佗即出自此脉，其家小留在真定，成为当地望族。蜀汉重要将门。赵云为“五虎上将”之一，以忠勇闻名。其子赵统袭爵，赵广随姜维战死。家族世代为将，是蜀汉政权中后期的重要军事力量。","en":"Descended from the Ying surname, a cadet branch of the royal house of Zhao during the Warring States period. In the Qin and Han eras, King Zhao Tuo of South Yue hailed from this lineage, his Family remained in Zhending, becoming a prominent local lineage. An essential military house of Shu Han, Zhao Yun was one of the ‘Five Tiger Generals,’ renowned for his loyalty and valor. His son Zhao Tong inherited his title, while Zhao Guang fell in battle alongside Jiang Wei. The Family produced generals across generations, standing as a vital military pillar in the mid-to-late period of Shu Han."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"3","politics":"4"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[68,67,61,54,70,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"W